==Overview==
The Mutant Assassin Toilet is a Mutant Toilet that appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and [[Endless Mode]]. It is a strong toilet and it can also stun [[Units]].

==Appearance==
This toilet is a toilet head with 4 limbs and a toilet body. It is holding a dagger and his face looks angry.
==Strategy==
*Use slowing units such as the [[Green Laser Cameraman]] to slow its speed and defeat it.
*This enemy is not that strong, you can use  the [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] or/and he [[Sinister Titan TV Man]] to defeat it.
*Use troops that can unstun such as [[Camera Repair Drone]], [[Speaker Repair Drone]], [[Medic Cameraman]], [[Streamer Cameraman]] and the [[Speaker Repair Drone]]
